hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1123","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se giri hui cheez ke bare mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Us ka bartan aur bandhan pehchano. Phir us ka ek saal elan karo. Phir agar us ka malik aaye, warna tumhara mamla us se hai. Us ne arz kiya: Phir bhatki hui bakri? Aap ne farmaya: Wo tumhare liye ya tumhare bhai ke liye ya bhediye ke liye hai. Us ne arz kiya: Phir bhatka hua oont? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe aur use kya? Us ke sath us ka mashkeeza aur joota hai. Wo pani par aata hai aur darakht khata hai yahan tak ke use us ka malik paye."
"1124","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein thaili payi jis mein sau deenar they. Phir main use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya. To Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elan karo. Phir main ne us ka ek saal elan kiya. Phir aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elan karo. Phir main ne us ka ek saal elan kiya. Phir Aap ke paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Us ka ek saal elan karo. Phir main ne us ka ek saal elan kiya. Phir chauthi martaba Aap ke paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Us ki ginti, bandhan aur bartan pehchano. Phir agar us ka malik aaye, warna us se faida uthao."
"1125","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi kisi shakhs ke maweshiyon ka doodh us ki ijazat ke baghair na dohe. Kya tum mein se ek pasand karta hai ke us ke doodh ki jagah aaya jaye aur us ka khazana toda jaye aur us ka khana muntaqil kiya jaye? Kyunke un ke maweshiyon ke than un ke khane khazana karte hain. Phir koi kisi ke maweshiyon ka doodh us ki ijazat ke siwa na dohe."
"1126","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Shuraih al-Adawi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere kanon ne suna aur meri aankhon ne dekha jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne guftagu farmayi. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne padosi ki izzat kare. Aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne mehmaan ki izzat kare, us ka inaam. Unhon ne kaha: Aur us ka inaam kya hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Ek din aur ek raat. Aur mehmaan-nawazi teen din hai. Phir jo is se zyada ho wo us par sadqa hai. Aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke bhalayi kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"1127","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Shuraih al-Ka'bi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne mehmaan ki izzat kare. Us ka inaam ek din aur ek raat hai. Aur mehmaan-nawazi teen din hai. Phir jo is ke baad ho wo sadqa hai. Aur us ke liye halal nahi ke wo us ke paas thehre yahan tak ke use tang kare."
"1128","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya: Beshak tum hamein bhejte ho. Phir hum qaum ke paas utarte hain jo hamari khatir nahi karte. Phir is mein tumhara kya khayal hai? To Aap ne hum se farmaya: Agar tum qaum ke paas utro aur tumhare liye wo hukm diya jaye jo mehmaan ke liye chahiye to qubool karo. Phir agar wo na karein to un se mehmaan ka haq lo."
